  "details": "Scene.GetRootGameObjects() is not exposed so it would be great if there was an alternative static method provided that returns an array of the root GameObjects in the scene.\n\nFor example:\n\nGameObject[] rootGameObjects = new GameObject[VRCScene.rootCount];\n\nVRCScene.GetRootGameObjects(rootGameObjects);\n\nor simply:\n\nGameObject[] rootGameObjects = VRCScene.GetRootGameObjects();\n\nReference: https://docs.unity3d.com/ScriptReference/SceneManagement.Scene.GetRootGameObjects.html",
